{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121172","id":4030601637,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7wPhml","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121172","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121172.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121172.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121172","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121172/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121172/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121172/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f2aa83aa12ea9b8ae955bb1236b030ac7ba93dbb","number":121172,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix physics picking for touch events on mobile","user":{"login":"duisterethomas","id":86431053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NDMxMDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86431053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas","html_url":"https://github.com/duisterethomas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duisterethomas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #109615\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nBefore my changes the `_process_picking()` function was returned early if the mouse was outside of the viewport. That caused all touch events to also be ignored if the mouse is outside of the viewport. From my testing this was an issue on mobile, but I haven't been able to test this on a pc, because I don't have a pc or laptop with a touchscreen. \r\n\r\nI've moved the \"mouse outside of viewport\" check into the `while (physics_picking_events.size())` loop and changed it to only check if the mouse was outside of the viewport if it is a mouse related event. Plus it now only skips that mouse event instead of the whole physics picking, because there can still be valid touch input events.\r\n\r\nI've also added a check to skip an event if the position of the event is outside of the viewport to make sure that touch events are also ignored if they occur outside of the viewport. This is to keep the intent of why lines 791-796 were originally added intact (see PR #58610).\r\n\r\nAnd for full disclosure, I haven't used AI for this fix.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","de